      "description": "<h3>Introduction</h3>\n<p>This mod adds the ability to scroll through the attachment menu in the weapon build screen. Includes config options to change column count and view height. That’s it!</p>\n<h3>Preview</h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8FyYMTg.gif\" alt=\"8FyYMTg.gif\" /></p>\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>Drag and drop, my friend</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" alt=\"wByb5Ln.gif\" /></p>\n<h3>Known Issues</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Incompatibility with <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1283/trader-modding-and-improved-weapon-building\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Trader Modding</a> where scrolling in the attachment list also zooms the weapon in/out. will address soon</li>\n</ul>\n",
